+Generic bit-counting builtins
+-----------------------------
+
+- Added ``__builtin_popcountg``, ``__builtin_clzg``, and ``__builtin_ctzg``
+  for unsigned integer types including extended and bit-precise integers.
+  They support constant evaluation without promoting their first operand.
+  Leading/trailing-zero builtins accept an optional ``int`` zero fallback.
 
